                        ],
                        "form": "den Unschlitt"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "9cfe014a-89ab-4ff7-90f2-b3081c0a2878",
                        "entry_id": "3b0acbb1-f5ec-3e26-8d23-63e2a04cdc70",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Unschlitte"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b8ba1fef-c4db-3dd2-a49c-14b604afa544",
                        "entry_id": "3b0acbb1-f5ec-3e26-8d23-63e2a04cdc70",
                        "glosses": [
                            "aus Wiederkäuern gewonnenes, festes Körperfett"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "outdated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0f1c1a8-d730-4237-ae08-82849ee72d2c",
                                "sense_id": "b8ba1fef-c4db-3dd2-a49c-14b604afa544",
                                "text": "„Da wir nun an den Ort kamen, wo das Duell ausgetragen werden sollte, hatte ich meine Muskete bereits mit zwei Kugeln geladen, frisches Zündkraut aufgerührt und den Deckel auf der Zündpfanne mit Unschlitt verschmiert, wie es vorsichtige Musketiere zu tun pflegen, wenn sie das Zündloch und Pulver auf der Pfanne im Regenwetter vor Wasser schützen wollen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0af8d17a-60f6-4584-aa18-3b04c02293be",
                                "sense_id": "b8ba1fef-c4db-3dd2-a49c-14b604afa544",
                                "text": "„Und nahm das ganze Unschlitt, das an dem Eingeweide und das Netz an der Leber und die beiden Nieren und deren Fett, und Mosche ließ es in Dampf aufgehen auf dem Altar.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfdb6fa9-c103-487b-bf9b-bd9fbc8e1814",
                                "sense_id": "b8ba1fef-c4db-3dd2-a49c-14b604afa544",
                                "text": "„Viel gemeiner und wohlfeiler ist der Unschlitt, der aus der Frucht des so genannten Unschlittbaums bereitet wird.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "234de445-2cf7-4e6f-bc08-86dbdac8f855",
                                "sense_id": "b8ba1fef-c4db-3dd2-a49c-14b604afa544",
                                "text": "„Man kann den Unschlitt erst zergehen lassen, und alsdann das Oel nachschütten, und eben so verfahren, als bei der Baumölseiffe erinnert worden.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3c8f3f2-0d9c-4e36-b724-37e6957c105f",
                                "sense_id": "b8ba1fef-c4db-3dd2-a49c-14b604afa544",
                                "text": "„Da der Unschlitt oft auch der Herstellung von Talglichtern (Kerzen) diente, wurden die Berufe des Seifensieders und des Lichtziehers nicht selten von ein und demselben Handwerker ausgeübt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f0f4b984-b436-4957-bfc5-f3443b7b895c",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b0acbb1-f5ec-3e26-8d23-63e2a04cdc70",
                        "source_sense_id": "b8ba1fef-c4db-3dd2-a49c-14b604afa544",
                        "source_sense_description": "veraltet: aus Wiederkäuern gewonnenes, festes Körperfett",
                        "target_lang_word": "tallow",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tallow",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d349434-f26c-3015-bd65-fee915180acd",
                                        "entry_id": "1dbbfaff-fec4-3d6d-b18e-bfb0a567bf98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hard animal fat obtained from suet, etc.; used in cooking as well as to make candles, soap and lubricants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b9195c6-af52-460f-8a07-58d7593decbf",
                                                "sense_id": "4d349434-f26c-3015-bd65-fee915180acd",
                                                "text": "\"I have got a very fine shirt, which I am going to use for my wedding shirt; but there are three tallow stains on it which I want washed out[.]\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f71d4703-fdd3-4910-b259-f5e04f6b1f01",
                                                "sense_id": "4d349434-f26c-3015-bd65-fee915180acd",
                                                "text": "Nor were the wool prospects much better. The pastoral industry, which had weathered the severe depression of the early forties by recourse to boiling down the sheep for their tallow, and was now firmly re-established as the staple industry of the colony, was threatened once more with eclipse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96ba7cf7-506a-4bd6-bb03-612e4faa8cf1",
                                                "sense_id": "4d349434-f26c-3015-bd65-fee915180acd",
                                                "text": "Rendering is done by boiling the animal carcasses to separate the fat from the meat. At high temperatures, the fat floats as a creamy white substance called tallow, while the heavier protein sinks to the bottom, producing greaves, which can be fed to animals. Tallow is used to make candle wax or is mixed with ash and heated again to form soap."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "tallow",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c32880d-a7ee-393c-aee2-66716e766c5d",
                                        "entry_id": "77581377-fb67-39d6-a369-27a834bfca1b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To grease or smear with tallow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a193b246-a900-355e-8f90-259dcfdc6ee7",
                                        "entry_id": "77581377-fb67-39d6-a369-27a834bfca1b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause to have a large quantity of tallow; to fatten."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e7c0570-069a-41ad-b9d1-0baadf76e123",
                                                "sense_id": "a193b246-a900-355e-8f90-259dcfdc6ee7",
                                                "text": "to tallow sheep"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ab80cfe-5375-3661-b9aa-b251e832d4af",
                                        "entry_id": "77581377-fb67-39d6-a369-27a834bfca1b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of animals: to develop quantities of tallow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4df69348-2d8a-427a-92bc-fcfeefff62ba",
                                                "sense_id": "0ab80cfe-5375-3661-b9aa-b251e832d4af",
                                                "text": "[…] their beef is finer than that of the old short-horned breed, and they fatten much earlier and quicker, conveying still a vast depth of natural flesh, and tallowing within in the first degree."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4df96f9f-9061-470f-ac81-2dc6b9b9ea43",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b0acbb1-f5ec-3e26-8d23-63e2a04cdc70",
                        "source_sense_id": "b8ba1fef-c4db-3dd2-a49c-14b604afa544",
                        "source_sense_description": "veraltet: aus Wiederkäuern gewonnenes, festes Körperfett",
                        "target_lang_word": "suif",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "suif",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2bc8e3e9-5a82-3ab9-961a-327db4ddefa4",
                                        "entry_id": "136fbf30-4fde-3bc9-9a8f-d78bca3f07ea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Graisse de certains animaux, dont on se sert principalement pour faire des chandelles et des bougies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69181afe-46fa-4814-a485-aa17ed927ff4",
                                                "sense_id": "2bc8e3e9-5a82-3ab9-961a-327db4ddefa4",
                                                "text": "Le suif de mouton mêlé à celui du bœuf, sert à faire des chandelles : on s'en sert pour les pommades & pour les onguents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "524af2cb-c2b4-43e1-b968-4aa19fc9780d",
                                                "sense_id": "2bc8e3e9-5a82-3ab9-961a-327db4ddefa4",
                                                "text": "Le battant s’ouvrit, et une vieille, protégeant d’une main sèche qui semblait prendre feu la flamme vacillante d’un suif, apparut dans toute l’horreur d’un négligé peu galant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8420cc1-5dd6-471e-bbb6-e3e91257a609",
                                                "sense_id": "2bc8e3e9-5a82-3ab9-961a-327db4ddefa4",
                                                "text": "A travers les plantes et la fournaise des bougies, elle verra parfaitement le défilé. Mais, en attendant, toutes ces flammes répandent une odeur désagréable de suif et de fumée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f191f982-4930-41b2-b13f-db80d5261e74",
                                                "sense_id": "2bc8e3e9-5a82-3ab9-961a-327db4ddefa4",
                                                "text": "Ils frappèrent à la porte du 7. Le garçon restait tapi au fond du couloir, et la bougie tremblait si fort dans sa main qu’elle aspergeait le plancher de gouttes de suif."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab676d72-0acd-402c-b915-d2535fe81dd0",
                                                "sense_id": "2bc8e3e9-5a82-3ab9-961a-327db4ddefa4",
                                                "text": "Donner du suif à un bâtiment. Enduire sa carène d’un mélange de suif, de brai et de soufre fondus ensemble."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6dcbb62-6b35-4a63-af3d-f09322047753",
                                                "sense_id": "2bc8e3e9-5a82-3ab9-961a-327db4ddefa4",
                                                "text": "Arbre à suif, Arbre de Chine dont les graines sont recouvertes d’une huile qui sert à faire des chandelles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "022e1126-b566-321e-92be-8dcd55ba6b99",
                                        "entry_id": "136fbf30-4fde-3bc9-9a8f-d78bca3f07ea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Argent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fcb8621d-12ad-3f4c-aa9a-6224fb6f8c14",
                                        "entry_id": "136fbf30-4fde-3bc9-9a8f-d78bca3f07ea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Grabuge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2696e46-411c-452c-bfa7-422232d6e21d",
                                                "sense_id": "fcb8621d-12ad-3f4c-aa9a-6224fb6f8c14",
                                                "text": "« Monsieur, c’était quinze jours, un mois après le suif à Ferdinand.\n– Ah ! oui, la perte du liquide pleurétique… sacré diable d’animal ! »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a814397e-c00a-4357-ae5e-ba309fa34066",
                                                "sense_id": "fcb8621d-12ad-3f4c-aa9a-6224fb6f8c14",
                                                "text": "En cas de suif imprévu, Tony et Dick pouvaient se permettre, avant que le pet soit donné, une prise de champ d’au moins vingt bornes…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a741142d-280f-4620-8dd2-9cc8de8eb9e9",
